      "content": "but there's no dignity in a coward's life. if i take my own life here, amidst the ruins... maybe that's the only way to reclaim any shred of honor. to end it on my own terms rather than waiting for the enemy to mock me. do you think... do you think a soldier can find peace by choosing his own end?",
